#13505
An Old Campsite, Deep Underground~
   The chamber isn't large, but it's large enough to rest comfortably and, for
the moment, it's safe. High above, you can scarcely make out the end of the
chute that deposited you here. Archways in the stone walls lead out in three
directions; chalk marks cover the stones next to each path.
~
