#13590
The Chamber at the Center of the Labyrinth~
   The narrow passage releases you into an oval chamber built from massive
stone blocks. Compared to the low, narrow corridors of the labyrinth, this
place is a palace. A foul stench permeates the stale air and sticks to your
clothing; this place has been closed off a time. Low dust clouds rise from the
layer of sand covering the floor, which is thin enough in places to see the
stones beneath. Bricked-up archways encircle the chamber. There's an old ladder
attached to one wall.
~
cdgk 0 0 13505
D8
~
